Package: rox-filer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: josejp2424 <puppylinuxjosejp2424@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libxml2, shared-mime-info
Provides: file-manager
Homepage: https://github.com/josejp2424/ROX-Filer-gtk3
Description: Lightweight GTK3 file manager and ROX Desktop
 ROX-Filer is a fast and lightweight GTK3 file manager.
 This build includes ROX Desktop, wallpaper management, desktop applications,
 drive icons, standard XDG MIME associations, trash support and templates.
